      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SURETHING (4) has raced two times this prep and has filled a minor placing on each occasion. Went well again last time at St Arnaud, finishing second and less than 7 metres from the winner. Peaking now so can take this out. SEW HOPEFULL (1) is a long-time maiden but has been going well and looks to have the hoof on the till after coming from much wider for second at Geelong last week, beaten a head. Should enjoy a nice run from the ace draw so could break through. BAD GRANDMA (2) is looming as a threat after a better effort in her second outing last start, finishing third at this circuit and distance. Draws lower and has scope for further improvement. BEAU BECA (8) cannot be left out after solid recent performances, the latest a sound third at this circuit and distance.",
